[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    515[0m:[38;5;10m[49m              (the returned value itself is uninitialised stack memory in C and \
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    516[0m:[38;5;10m[49m              is documented in ERRORS.md as not byte-comparable)"
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    517[0m:[38;5;10m[49m         );
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    518[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     }
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    519[0m:[38;5;10m[49m }
