[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    522[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Row 22 — driver(NULL): glibc dereferences the pointer. UNDEFINED BEHAVIOUR;
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    523[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // asserted out-of-process so both libraries must fail the SAME way.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    524[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
